            "sid": "NUM 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hoshaku nawanyana kaIsarela, wuyili neyi, Neyi muntu weyala hela wamumbanda wukudishiila kuchuma chalema, nakwikala kaNaziri, nindi adambuli ekali wambala waYehova; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akadambuli nikuvinyu nikuwalwa; kunwa hela vineŋa yavinyu, helavineŋa yawalwa nehi, kunwa meji anyikabu yamuvinyu nehi, hela kudyanyikabu yamuvinyu hela yituuta hela yayumu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku akudambulayi ejima kudya chuma chakwila nayakufuma kumuvinyu hela nteta helaifuku nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku akwambuka kwadishiililiyi ejima, ntewula kuhita kunamutu windinehi; wakajilaŋa ho-o ninichi chakawanina mafuku adambwiliyi ekaliwambala waYehova, nyizenza yansuki jindi wakayilekapa tuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku ejima anadambuliyi kwikala waYehova kudata kudi mufunehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi tata yindi nafwi, hela mama yindi, hela mana kwindi, helamuhelindi, kudiŋilolaku nehi, muloŋa kwambuka kwamwambukilayi Nzambi yindi kudi kunamutu windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku akwambukayi ejima najilili dehi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muntu namufwili kwakwihi chakukasumuka, niyena najiloli dehi namutu wakwambuka kwambukiliyi, akatewuli namutu windi ifuku dadikosayi, wakawutewula ifuku damu chitanu nachiyedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku damu chitanu nachisatu hakaleta kudi kapristu kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena tutela tuyedi, hela anyana katupompa ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu akalambuli wumu wamulambu wahanshidi, mukwawu wamulambu wakushita, akamubuti nachu nanochu chanavulumuniyi hansaŋu yamufu, akajiliki namutu windi ifuku dodimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamwambwili Yehova mafuku indi akwambuka, akaleti mwana kamukoku wachizamba chamwaka wumu chamulambu wakutanya, mafuku akusambila anayi dehi mumeji, muloŋa kwambuka kwaambukiliyi kunajiloli dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu lushimbi lwakaNaziri lwahakawanishilayi mafuku indi aambukiliyi; akamuleta kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akahimulambu li Yehova himulambu windi, mwana kamukoku wumu wachizamba chamwaka wumu, wakadi ninaha hatamayi, wamulambu wakushita, ni mwana kamukoku wamukaji wumu wamwaka wumu, wakadi ninaha hatamayi, wamulambu wahanshidi, nichizamba chamukoku wumu wakadi ninaha hatamayi, wanyilambu yakuwunda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niibapu damankendi yakadi ilupi, nimankendi awuŋa walembuluka wakubomba namanji, nitumankendi twawubasa twakadi iluŋi twakukwita manji, nihimulambu wayu wawuŋa, nihimulambu wayu wakuhuŋununa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu hakayitula kumesu aYehova, hakalambula nihimulambu windi wahanshidi, nihimulambu windi wakushita; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakahimulambu la Yehova chizamba chachimuna wanyilambu yakuwunda, hamu nebaŋuda mankendi akadi iluŋi; kapristu akalambuli nihimulambu wayu wawuŋa, nihimulambu wayu wakuhuŋununa nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KaNaziri akatewili namutu wakwambukakwa ambukiliyi kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena, akanoni nsuki janamutu wakwambuka kwaambukiliyi, akajishi hakesi kadi mwishina dachimuna chanyilambu yakuwunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu akanoni chikasa chachiza mbachakuteleka dehi, mwibaŋu akanonumu dinkendi dimu dakadi iluŋi, nikadinkendi kawubasa kamu kakadi iluŋi, akayishi mumakasa akaNaziri, hakelayi natewuli dehi kwambuka kwambukiliyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kapristu hakayinyinkesha himulambu wakunyinkesha kumesu aYehova; yumiyi ayijilikila kapristu, hamu nebwambu dakunyinkesha nimwendu wakuleleka nawa, neyi yumiyi yinamani dehi, kaNaziri hakadinwinaŋa kwindi nivinyu yindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
